# Coflow straggler demo: 8 senders -> node 0 (receiver)
# Flows 1-7: 1MiB each (leaders)
# Flow 8: 8MiB (straggler, 8x longer)
# All share recv_done_trigger 1 -> same coflow ID
Nodes 1024
Connections 8
1->0 id 1 start 0 size 1048576 recv_done_trigger 1
2->0 id 2 start 0 size 1048576 recv_done_trigger 1
3->0 id 3 start 0 size 1048576 recv_done_trigger 1
4->0 id 4 start 0 size 1048576 recv_done_trigger 1
5->0 id 5 start 0 size 1048576 recv_done_trigger 1
6->0 id 6 start 0 size 1048576 recv_done_trigger 1
7->0 id 7 start 0 size 1048576 recv_done_trigger 1
8->0 id 8 start 0 size 8388608 recv_done_trigger 1
